A nice strategy that has worked often for me is to
have _two_ large XL 9 XP 72 dogs/cats on leash, walk
up to the watch captain without hitting him/her, and
so not getting attacked in return, and let the pets
*divide* the damage _from_ the watch captain while
*combining* their damage _to_ the watch captain.

That isn't 100% guaranteed, but the combined 144 HP
works maybe 80% of the time to keep at least one of
the pets alive until the watch captain is toast, at
very low risk to the PC except maybe having to tame
and level up some more pets, and meanwhile the PC is
free to obliterate any of the usual popcorn monsters
wandering around mines town who try to interrupt the
affair.

I especially like trying this because I have a _lot_
of lust for that possible silver saber.

